    https://www.faa.gov/air_traffic/flight_info/aeronav/aero_data (https://www.faa.gov/air_traffic/flight_info/aeronav/aero_data)
  - The AIM/AIP material confirms SUA is authoritative FAA airspace content, but that’s descriptive text, not a geometry download:
      - https://www.faa.gov/air_traffic/publications/atpubs/aip_html/part2_enr_section_5.1.html
